lesson.visualExplanation:
INTERSECT:
  Set A = {1, 2, 3, 4}
  Set B = {3, 4, 5, 6}
  A INTERSECT B = {3, 4}    → only what's in BOTH

EXCEPT:
  Set A = {1, 2, 3, 4}
  Set B = {3, 4, 5, 6}
  A EXCEPT B = {1, 2}       → in A but NOT in B

